OL,3,GNEWSASeven men sentenced over #1m
OL,4,Ainvestment scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven men have been sentenced for
OL,7,Fscamming 31 people out of more than #1m
OL,8,Fthrough a Dubai-based investment fraud.
OL,10,FBetween March and June 2020, Daron
OL,11,FBenjamin, Leon Groom, Jacob Smith,
OL,12,FAnthony Kensington, Ioan Dark, Kevin
OL,13,FMoyles and James Underwood all "sold"
OL,14,Finvestment bonds to victims in the UK,
OL,15,Fwhich were then transferred to other
OL,16,Ffraudsters in Dubai.
OL,18,FDerbyshire Police said the victims were
OL,19,Fdefrauded of #1,196,000 in total, with
OL,20,Fsome losing more than #100,000.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
